<% content_for :title, "About - MLBB Heroes" %>

<div class="about-page">
  <header class="page-header">
    <h1>About MLBB Heroes App</h1>
    <p class="subtitle">Learn more about the app and its features</p>
  </header>

  <div class="about-content">
    <p>A mobile multiplayer online battle arena game developed and published by Chinese developer Moonton.<br>
      This game was released in 2016 and grew popularity most prominently in Southeast Asia.</p>

    <h2>About This App</h2>
    <p>The MLBB Heroes app allows you to:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Browse all Mobile Legends heroes</li>
      <li>View detailed hero information including roles, specialties, and difficulty ratings</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Hero Attributes</h2>
    <div class="hero-attributes">
      <h3>Roles:</h3>
      <p>Tank, Fighter, Assassin, Mage, Marksman, Support</p>

      <h3>Lanes:</h3>
      <p>Exp Lane, Jungle, Mid Lane, Gold Lane, Roam</p>

      <h3>Specialties:</h3>
      <p>Charge, Regen, Burst, Poke, Push, Support</p>

      <h3>Difficulty:</h3>
      <p>Rated from 1 (Easy) to 10 (Very Hard)</p>
    </div>
</div>



